WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.100 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 5=

01:48.071 --> 01:49.110
Have you made up your mind?

01:49.980 --> 01:51.290
If you tell me the truth now,

01:51.730 --> 01:52.530
we can still

01:53.540 --> 01:55.140
resolve this issue internally.

01:55.537 --> 01:57.604
But if you keep
on deceiving the organization

01:57.604 --> 01:58.420
and me,

01:59.290 --> 02:00.780
that'll be a different story.

02:06.940 --> 02:08.370
Ms. Xu,

02:08.370 --> 02:09.300
he...

02:12.640 --> 02:14.180
He...

02:15.150 --> 02:17.300
Indeed. He hasn't recovered completely.

02:18.070 --> 02:20.130
But he's starting to recall something.

02:20.130 --> 02:21.537
I'm sure he'll recall everything

02:21.560 --> 02:23.180
before long.

02:23.370 --> 02:24.250
Fei Ni,

02:24.770 --> 02:25.990
are you confessing

02:26.450 --> 02:27.940
that you had colluded with Fang Muyang

02:27.940 --> 02:29.090
to deceive Ms. Xu

02:29.090 --> 02:30.300
and the organization?

02:30.300 --> 02:30.740
No.

02:31.340 --> 02:32.900
Ms. Xu, that's not true.

02:33.130 --> 02:34.910
This has nothing to do with Fang Muyang.

02:34.910 --> 02:36.410
I was the one who sought his help...

02:36.410 --> 02:37.300
Such nonsense!

02:38.020 --> 02:38.990
This is ridiculous!

02:41.900 --> 02:43.690
You've deeply disappointed me.

02:46.140 --> 02:47.970
I would've still been kept in the dark,

02:48.120 --> 02:49.940
had Feng Lin not found out!

02:52.048 --> 02:53.180
I understand your feelings.

02:53.782 --> 02:56.000
I know you want to attend college
and improve yourself.

02:56.520 --> 02:58.410
But you used the wrong method.

02:59.130 --> 03:00.650
If news of this gets out,

03:00.820 --> 03:03.020
not only will it affect your reputation,

03:03.200 --> 03:05.020
but it'll also affect
Fang Muyang's image

03:05.020 --> 03:06.880
as a hero, you know?

03:12.680 --> 03:13.870
Sorry, Ms. Xu.

03:15.120 --> 03:15.950
I know my fault now.

03:16.382 --> 03:17.970
Hurry and write a reflection report.

03:19.182 --> 03:21.360
You'd better reflect upon
your actions deeply.

03:22.080 --> 03:23.330
I'll surely do so.

03:26.048 --> 03:27.060
As for the selection of

03:27.840 --> 03:28.820
advanced individuals

03:29.290 --> 03:30.530
for college admission,

03:30.982 --> 03:32.226
we'll put it aside for now.

04:04.970 --> 04:06.650
(Ms. Xu wouldn't just let you off)

04:06.650 --> 04:08.500
(by telling you
to write a reflection report,)

04:08.500 --> 04:09.350
(had she not wanted)

04:09.471 --> 04:11.250
(to maintain
Fang Muyang's image as a hero.)

04:13.060 --> 04:14.460
You should be grateful for that.

04:19.450 --> 04:21.000
Why do you keep picking on me?

04:22.890 --> 04:25.610
It's because I corrected your typo, right?

04:26.270 --> 04:26.800
Yeah.

04:28.640 --> 04:29.590
I just hate you.

04:30.293 --> 04:32.310
You think that you're more
well-educated than me.

04:33.550 --> 04:35.360
You always embarrass me in public.

04:40.515 --> 04:43.293
But exposing your actions
has nothing to do with this matter.

04:44.010 --> 04:45.850
If you're unable to attend college,

04:46.060 --> 04:48.150
my boyfriend won't be able
to attend college as well.

04:49.570 --> 04:50.640
I'll tell you this upfront.

04:51.600 --> 04:53.340
Ms. Xu told me this just now.

04:54.210 --> 04:55.210
Your actions

04:55.540 --> 04:56.550
have given her a reminder.

04:57.600 --> 05:00.210
We mustn't tolerate
this corrupt practice

05:00.210 --> 05:02.390
of cheating and taking shortcuts.

05:03.848 --> 05:06.048
So she'll discuss this
with the factory's higher-ups.

05:06.510 --> 05:08.750
In the future, no matter
if it's advanced individuals

05:08.860 --> 05:10.190
or a model hero,

05:11.940 --> 05:13.550
when it comes to college admission,

05:14.360 --> 05:16.100
everyone will be treated as equal.

05:16.960 --> 05:17.850
That means,

05:18.630 --> 05:21.010
even if Fang Muyang does
recover fully in the future,

05:21.440 --> 05:24.210
and you become the city's
model of excellence,

05:25.040 --> 05:27.740
your name will never appear on
the college recommendation list of

05:30.110 --> 05:32.260
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory.

05:42.930 --> 05:44.090
Fang Muyang,

05:44.090 --> 05:45.360
you're indeed very aware.

05:45.700 --> 05:47.350
The hospital
is running out of resources.

05:47.600 --> 05:49.710
As for you,
you've almost fully recovered.

05:50.340 --> 05:53.550
The director said that we should reserve
this ward for those who are in need.

05:53.604 --> 05:55.648
So I have no choice
but to change your ward.

05:57.180 --> 05:58.240
You're just doing your job.

06:00.620 --> 06:01.610
Who's this girl?

06:03.550 --> 06:04.270
I don't remember.

06:06.960 --> 06:07.520
All done.

06:50.540 --> 06:52.040
I don't know what to do now.

06:56.010 --> 06:57.330
All these years,

06:59.940 --> 07:02.250
attending college
has always been my only way out.

07:05.010 --> 07:06.810
Now, my only way out
has been sealed off.

07:09.960 --> 07:11.600
No one can seal off

07:15.420 --> 07:16.740
one's true path of life.

08:31.150 --> 08:33.230
What do you think about the movie?

08:33.893 --> 08:34.860
You don't like it, huh?

08:35.790 --> 08:37.150
I see.

08:37.870 --> 08:38.780
Lin Mei, that's fine.

08:38.900 --> 08:40.780
We'll catch other movies next time.

08:40.780 --> 08:41.360
Lin Mei?

08:43.060 --> 08:43.700
Fei Ni?

08:46.090 --> 08:47.570
Chen Yunguo?

08:49.210 --> 08:49.640
So,

08:50.180 --> 08:51.380
you guys can go ahead.

08:51.380 --> 08:52.382
I'll make a move first.

08:55.020 --> 08:55.870
Do you know him?

08:56.210 --> 08:57.500
What are you two doing together?

08:57.648 --> 08:59.982
He's the blind date partner
my mother introduced to me.

09:03.490 --> 09:05.320
Did my brother make you angry again?

09:05.580 --> 09:06.290
Tell me.

09:06.690 --> 09:07.560
I'll tell him off.

09:07.860 --> 09:09.960
It's pointless no matter
who tells him off this time.

09:10.140 --> 09:10.930
Your brother and I

09:10.940 --> 09:12.570
have fallen out
with each other entirely.

09:12.570 --> 09:13.410
But why?

09:13.410 --> 09:15.330
I thought you two were
doing great before this.

09:15.340 --> 09:17.309
It's been over a year
since I returned to the city.

09:17.310 --> 09:19.093
Whenever I urged him
to come back to the city,

09:19.093 --> 09:20.515
he always had all kinds of excuses.

09:22.300 --> 09:23.289
Out of spite, I told him

09:23.290 --> 09:25.620
that I would find another boyfriend
if he didn't come back.

09:27.660 --> 09:28.540
Guess what he said?

09:32.450 --> 09:33.000
He said...

09:35.020 --> 09:36.490
He said he wanted to break up with me.

09:39.570 --> 09:41.940
How could Fei Ting
say something like that?

09:41.940 --> 09:42.800
I'll talk to him.

09:43.020 --> 09:44.537
I'll tell him to apologize to you.

09:44.970 --> 09:46.048
Actually, my parents

09:46.048 --> 09:48.820
wanted to arrange blind dates for me
six months ago.

09:49.280 --> 09:50.360
I tried my best to delay it.

09:51.204 --> 09:52.670
But judging from Fei Ting's attitude,

09:53.260 --> 09:55.160
I don't think
our relationship will bear fruit.

09:56.300 --> 09:56.960
Fei Ni,

09:58.020 --> 09:59.370
I'm already 27 years old.

09:59.537 --> 10:01.537
I can't afford
to wait for him any longer.

10:03.560 --> 10:04.730
I've already made up my mind.

10:06.420 --> 10:07.590
If he still doesn't come back,

10:10.210 --> 10:11.950
I'll get myself another boyfriend.

10:12.390 --> 10:13.940
I'll send him a telegram tomorrow.

10:14.330 --> 10:16.850
I'll tell him
to come back immediately, okay?

10:16.850 --> 10:18.020
Don't cry.

10:18.020 --> 10:19.790
It doesn't matter who speaks to him,

10:19.790 --> 10:20.660
especially you.

10:21.020 --> 10:22.120
But why?

10:22.182 --> 10:23.160
He refused to come back

10:23.170 --> 10:25.950
because he was afraid you might
have no place to stay after his return.

10:41.110 --> 10:41.650
Fei Ni,

10:42.300 --> 10:43.660
that's not what I mean.

10:43.804 --> 10:44.590
Don't overthink it.

10:44.790 --> 10:45.250
I...

10:45.537 --> 10:46.590
You see, for this matter...

10:49.420 --> 10:50.560
It's all my fault.

10:51.780 --> 10:53.090
My parents kept telling me

10:53.090 --> 10:54.640
to find a partner who owns a house.

10:55.330 --> 10:56.560
Anyway, you guys own a house.

10:56.893 --> 10:58.200
So I think it's okay.

10:58.671 --> 11:00.490
I only realized it
when Fei Ting said so.

11:03.960 --> 11:05.680
It's all my fault.
That was plain nonsense.

11:05.680 --> 11:06.810
- No.
- Don't take it to heart.

11:06.810 --> 11:08.000
- Don't overthink it.
- How could it be your fault?

11:08.000 --> 11:10.200
The expectations of your parents
are already low enough.

11:13.610 --> 11:15.040
I'm just mad at Fei Ting.

11:16.660 --> 11:19.120
No matter how tough he has it,

11:19.426 --> 11:20.530
he should come back first.

11:20.790 --> 11:22.660
We can figure out
a solution after that, right?

11:22.893 --> 11:24.360
How could he do something like this?

11:24.604 --> 11:25.780
He kept delaying his return,

11:25.780 --> 11:27.620
and saying
that he wanted to break up with me.

11:28.660 --> 11:29.210
Fei Ni,

11:29.810 --> 11:31.630
I truly don't know what to do now.

11:34.540 --> 11:35.210
Don't cry.

12:06.360 --> 12:07.360
(He refused to come back)

12:07.360 --> 12:10.271
(because he was afraid you might
have no place to stay after his return.)

12:13.660 --> 12:15.030
(Slow down. It's hot.)

12:15.260 --> 12:15.760
(Ting.)

12:15.960 --> 12:17.360
(Young Fei Ni)
Let's take half each.

12:17.360 --> 12:18.071
(Young Fei Ting)

12:18.115 --> 12:19.000
I don't want it.

12:19.210 --> 12:20.650
Milk isn't as nice as milk crumble.

12:20.900 --> 12:21.520
Is that so?

12:22.590 --> 12:23.520
Let's swap, then.

12:24.000 --> 12:25.120
I'll have the milk crumbles.

12:26.270 --> 12:27.850
That won't do. Dad and Mom aren't home.

12:27.850 --> 12:29.680
I'm your elder brother.
I make the call here.

12:29.810 --> 12:32.093
You have to finish the milk.
I'll finish the milk crumble.

13:03.540 --> 13:05.270
Ni, I finished wrapping your book.

13:09.850 --> 13:10.610
So nice.

13:19.330 --> 13:19.840
Ting,

13:20.660 --> 13:22.530
why is your pencil case in my bag?

13:24.060 --> 13:25.380
It's so new.

13:25.380 --> 13:26.130
It's a waste

13:26.380 --> 13:27.080
if I use it.

13:27.690 --> 13:29.760
From tomorrow on,
you'll be in primary school.

13:29.900 --> 13:31.600
Do your best, and get into college.

13:31.900 --> 13:33.380
Once you become a college student,

13:33.380 --> 13:34.400
I'll send you to college.

13:34.690 --> 13:35.470
This won't do.

13:35.660 --> 13:38.300
Dad and Mom bought this for you
as your birthday gift.

13:38.300 --> 13:39.210
Even so, that won't do.

13:39.210 --> 13:41.226
I'm your elder brother.
I make the call here.

13:41.380 --> 13:42.260
But Ting,

13:42.540 --> 13:43.540
what about you?

13:47.780 --> 13:50.040
Look. I made a new one for myself.

13:50.900 --> 13:51.910
Aren't I amazing?

13:53.180 --> 13:53.760
You are.

14:02.610 --> 14:03.290
Dad.

14:03.780 --> 14:04.610
Mom.

14:05.140 --> 14:07.090
Why did you guys stop me from going?

14:07.090 --> 14:08.004
I'm a recent graduate.

14:08.004 --> 14:10.480
According to the government policy,
I should be the one going.

14:11.140 --> 14:12.730
You still have an elder brother at home.

14:12.730 --> 14:14.648
It's not your turn to be
sent to Great Northern Wilderness.

14:14.660 --> 14:16.671
I've discussed this
with the Educated Youth Office.

14:16.937 --> 14:18.140
I'll head there on your behalf.

14:18.690 --> 14:20.340
But I thought
we already had a consensus.

14:20.340 --> 14:21.330
Once Mom retires,

14:21.330 --> 14:24.048
you'll take over her position
at Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory.

14:24.300 --> 14:25.830
I'm a man, you know?

14:25.970 --> 14:28.240
Why should I work
at Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory?

14:28.248 --> 14:30.226
I would rather head
to Great Northern Wilderness.

14:30.900 --> 14:31.690
Besides,

14:31.690 --> 14:33.010
according to the newspaper,

14:33.260 --> 14:35.010
the world is full of
great opportunities.

14:37.315 --> 14:38.140
(Just listen to me.)

14:38.160 --> 14:39.470
(I'll head to Great Northern Wilderness)

14:39.470 --> 14:41.290
(while you head to
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory. Done.)

14:41.300 --> 14:43.420
(In the future,
I'll leave our parents in your care.)

14:58.410 --> 14:58.960
Ting.

14:59.760 --> 15:01.350
(I was too selfish.)

15:02.020 --> 15:05.240
(You've devoted yourself to me
all this while.)

15:05.540 --> 15:06.260
(This time,)

15:07.540 --> 15:08.730
(you have to heed my will.)

15:45.020 --> 15:45.810
Fei Ni.

15:47.030 --> 15:47.520
Lin Mei.

15:49.760 --> 15:51.740
I thought you would
never talk to me again.

15:52.140 --> 15:53.610
How could that be?

15:53.626 --> 15:56.160
Where else can I get myself
an excellent sister-in-law like you?

15:59.780 --> 16:00.450
Lin Mei.

16:03.690 --> 16:04.800
I never expected myself

16:06.420 --> 16:08.670
to be the obstacle between you and Ting.

16:09.420 --> 16:10.610
Hey, don't say that.

16:10.610 --> 16:11.560
Let me finish.

16:14.450 --> 16:15.130
Ting

16:15.540 --> 16:16.790
doted on me since I was a child.

16:17.380 --> 16:19.300
And, you're my best friend.

16:19.970 --> 16:21.920
You guys are my closest kin,

16:23.248 --> 16:25.860
yet I wasn't aware of
the difficulties you two were facing.

16:26.670 --> 16:27.840
How could this be your fault?

16:29.337 --> 16:30.810
Fei Ni, I'll be honest with you.

16:31.090 --> 16:32.370
Initially, I thought

16:32.404 --> 16:34.293
that if you attended
college successfully,

16:34.293 --> 16:36.160
you'd definitely move
to the college's dorm.

16:36.226 --> 16:37.780
If so, the issue between Fei Ting and I

16:37.780 --> 16:38.900
would be resolved.

16:40.660 --> 16:43.200
But I didn't expect your enrollment

16:44.300 --> 16:45.810
to still be hanging in the air.

16:46.660 --> 16:47.730
It's not confirmed yet.

16:50.540 --> 16:51.090
Lin Mei,

16:53.900 --> 16:54.990
I came here today

16:55.090 --> 16:56.270
to tell you this.

16:59.210 --> 17:00.570
Since we were good friends

17:00.570 --> 17:01.810
for so many years,

17:02.040 --> 17:03.010
can you give him...

17:03.810 --> 17:04.350
No, I mean,

17:05.660 --> 17:07.450
can you give our family
a little more time?

17:11.210 --> 17:12.320
Just three months.

17:13.210 --> 17:14.010
I promise.

17:14.010 --> 17:16.190
I'll make him come back
and marry you in three months.

17:16.820 --> 17:17.520
Okay?

17:18.404 --> 17:20.293
Are you sure you can
convince him to come back?

17:20.490 --> 17:21.100
I promise.

17:25.490 --> 17:26.900
Actually, I didn't intend

17:26.900 --> 17:28.500
to go on real blind dates either.

17:29.860 --> 17:31.570
I did it to shut my parents up.

17:32.380 --> 17:33.240
I know.

17:33.530 --> 17:35.520
You'll become
my sister-in-law sooner or later.

17:35.690 --> 17:36.440
There's no escape.

17:51.450 --> 17:52.620
Dad, Mom.

17:52.937 --> 17:55.204
- I'm back.
- I thought you went to the hospital.

17:56.770 --> 17:58.340
I didn't go to the hospital today.

18:03.970 --> 18:04.530
Mom,

18:05.380 --> 18:06.380
before this,

18:07.250 --> 18:08.940
did someone arrange

18:09.050 --> 18:10.250
blind dates for me?

18:13.180 --> 18:14.180
Yeah.

18:14.180 --> 18:15.580
But I canceled them.

18:16.000 --> 18:17.940
You were bent on attending college.

18:18.250 --> 18:19.490
I've already figured it out.

18:19.582 --> 18:21.490
I've discussed this
with your father as well.

18:21.582 --> 18:24.280
It's good for youngsters like you all
to have dreams and ambitions.

18:24.580 --> 18:25.760
We won't rush things

18:26.190 --> 18:27.530
as long as you're happy.

18:27.530 --> 18:28.400
But I'm in a rush now.

18:32.290 --> 18:33.200
I've already decided.

18:33.382 --> 18:34.848
I'm going to go on blind dates.

18:35.720 --> 18:36.910
But there are two conditions.

18:38.048 --> 18:39.071
First condition,

18:39.293 --> 18:41.950
he needs to own a house
or be eligible for a housing allocation.

18:42.160 --> 18:43.271
Second condition,

18:44.293 --> 18:46.026
he must be less than 30 years old,

18:46.293 --> 18:48.004
and look like a decent person.

18:52.620 --> 18:54.050
Are my standards

18:54.050 --> 18:55.450
too high?

18:55.450 --> 18:57.960
Not at all.
You're more than good enough.

18:58.004 --> 19:00.210
I'm sure you can find
all kinds of ideal partners.

19:00.340 --> 19:02.170
I'll arrange the blind dates
for you tomorrow.

19:04.820 --> 19:07.780
Ni, what's with
the sudden change of mind?

19:11.220 --> 19:12.780
Mom already said it, right?

19:13.115 --> 19:14.671
Since I have to get married eventually,

19:14.693 --> 19:16.400
it's better for me to get married early.

19:17.940 --> 19:19.140
That's the spirit.

19:19.140 --> 19:20.540
I'm glad that you've figured it out.

19:20.940 --> 19:23.010
I was so anxious the past two months.

19:23.010 --> 19:25.450
I was worried
that you would look after that hero

19:25.450 --> 19:26.860
in order to attend college,

19:27.210 --> 19:29.180
ruining your marriage in the process.

19:36.100 --> 19:36.550
Dad,

19:37.430 --> 19:37.910
Mom,

19:40.210 --> 19:41.290
I've made you guys worried.

19:42.140 --> 19:43.120
I won't do it again.

19:45.800 --> 19:46.320
Ni,

19:46.620 --> 19:49.300
you were obedient and intelligent
since you were a child.

19:49.660 --> 19:50.620
Your mother and I

19:50.760 --> 19:52.315
will support your every decision.

19:53.860 --> 19:54.290
Okay.

20:02.210 --> 20:03.140
Ms. Liu.

20:04.570 --> 20:05.350
Hi, Fei Ni.

20:05.350 --> 20:05.750
Hi.

20:05.750 --> 20:06.471
Come quickly.

20:09.820 --> 20:11.480
You look gorgeous today.

20:13.404 --> 20:16.320
You see, when your mother told me
that you were looking for a husband,

20:16.320 --> 20:18.093
I was reminded of
a candidate immediately.

20:18.250 --> 20:20.400
That guy has got it all.

20:20.580 --> 20:21.580
Most importantly,

20:22.010 --> 20:24.330
he has been inquiring about you
from me before this.

20:25.610 --> 20:26.660
Does he know me?

20:26.660 --> 20:28.270
Perhaps you know him.

20:31.440 --> 20:31.990
He's here.

20:39.620 --> 20:40.480
Ye Feng, you're here.

20:43.970 --> 20:45.210
Due to your urgent need,

20:45.426 --> 20:47.550
I haven't had the time
to report your blind date

20:47.550 --> 20:50.000
with Fei Ni to Ms. Xu yet.

20:50.026 --> 20:52.115
- I'll report to her later...
- Ms. Liu, don't worry.

20:52.137 --> 20:53.530
My mom has to listen to me.

20:53.582 --> 20:54.900
I'll tell her about it later.

20:56.070 --> 20:57.010
Alright.

21:04.071 --> 21:05.515
I'll introduce you two to each other.

21:05.730 --> 21:06.540
This is Fei Ni.

21:06.915 --> 21:07.660
This is Ye Feng.

21:08.050 --> 21:09.970
Ye Feng is on
the factory's basketball team.

21:10.426 --> 21:12.360
I'm sure you saw him
playing basketball before.

21:16.871 --> 21:17.693
Nice to meet you.

21:19.360 --> 21:20.120
Nice to meet you.

21:20.490 --> 21:21.020
Alright.

21:22.010 --> 21:22.970
You guys can go ahead.

21:22.970 --> 21:24.604
I have something else to do. I'll leave.

21:47.010 --> 21:47.820
Fang Muyang,

21:47.820 --> 21:49.315
remember to finish your milk today.

21:49.660 --> 21:50.280
Thanks.

21:53.660 --> 21:56.310
Who exactly is this girl?

21:56.790 --> 21:58.220
Why do you keep drawing her?

21:59.040 --> 21:59.750
I don't know.

22:00.448 --> 22:02.130
I've been dreaming
of her all this while.

22:03.530 --> 22:05.530
If so, she must be important to you.

22:06.100 --> 22:06.970
Nurse Zhou,

22:07.626 --> 22:09.190
why isn't Fei Ni here to visit me?

22:10.340 --> 22:12.190
Fei Ni needs to work too.

22:12.290 --> 22:15.830
Besides, she's not related to you.

22:16.026 --> 22:18.093
- She didn't need to visit you daily.
- Nurse Zhou.

22:20.530 --> 22:21.660
Can you do me a favor?

22:30.580 --> 22:31.820
This is my first blind date.

22:33.860 --> 22:34.730
Me too.

22:40.671 --> 22:41.404
So you...

22:41.660 --> 22:42.880
What do you usually

22:44.580 --> 22:45.680
do?

22:45.690 --> 22:47.280
Have there been any tournaments lately?

22:47.620 --> 22:48.820
Nope.

22:49.450 --> 22:52.770
We had a friendly match
at Jiangcheng College last time.

22:52.770 --> 22:54.180
It was just a spar.

22:54.360 --> 22:56.399
We train when there
aren't any tournaments.

22:56.400 --> 22:58.026
Because in the second half of the year,

22:58.026 --> 23:00.710
there's a city-wide basketball
tournament for the textile industry.

23:00.715 --> 23:01.770
We have to win it.

23:01.826 --> 23:03.680
So everyone is training
with great enthusiasm.

23:03.848 --> 23:05.693
You must come and spectate us by then.

23:07.230 --> 23:07.680
Alright.

23:09.620 --> 23:10.290
What about you?

23:10.660 --> 23:12.340
What do you like to do usually?

23:12.820 --> 23:14.340
I like

23:14.860 --> 23:16.250
to read.

23:16.450 --> 23:17.150
You like to read?

23:18.230 --> 23:19.250
I like to read, too.

23:20.004 --> 23:21.450
What kinds of books do you like?

23:21.970 --> 23:23.340
I like to read

23:23.582 --> 23:25.140
"The Taking of Tiger Mountain",

23:25.140 --> 23:25.950
"The Battle of Wits",

23:25.960 --> 23:27.860
and the books about
Chen Sheng, Wu Guang, or Huang Jiguang.

23:27.860 --> 23:28.860
I like them the most.

23:32.380 --> 23:33.690
Let's catch a movie later.

23:34.100 --> 23:35.860
I heard that a new Romanian movie

23:35.860 --> 23:37.180
has been aired lately.

23:37.180 --> 23:38.271
And, people liked it.

23:39.860 --> 23:40.450
Okay.

23:40.626 --> 23:41.210
Let's go.

23:44.300 --> 23:47.260
(Workers' Club)

23:47.260 --> 23:49.220
(Why are you shouting? I'm not deaf.)

23:49.220 --> 23:49.980
(Look.)

23:50.540 --> 23:52.740
(Did the boat that departed
yesterday make it across?)

23:53.020 --> 23:54.140
(You must defuse the mines.)

23:54.140 --> 23:55.982
("Waves of the Danube", Romania)
(I thought we had a bomb squad.)

23:55.982 --> 23:56.820
(What are they doing?)

23:56.820 --> 23:58.093
(Let's drop the anchor, then.)

23:58.093 --> 23:59.500
(Do as you see fit.)

23:59.780 --> 24:01.300
(That's an order from the Germans.)

24:02.404 --> 24:03.980
(Don't you intend to send her back?)

24:05.660 --> 24:06.380
(No.)

24:08.560 --> 24:10.380
(I'm the helmsman.
I cannot leave the ship.)

24:10.540 --> 24:11.620
(I have four children.)

24:11.626 --> 24:12.760
(I should die in my home,)
Ye Feng.

24:12.804 --> 24:13.740
(not on the sea.)

24:13.740 --> 24:15.115
(Stop your nagging and just go.)

24:16.450 --> 24:17.390
Did I fall asleep?

24:17.900 --> 24:19.500
(The master will hear us, you know?)

24:19.740 --> 24:20.460
(He won't.)

24:20.460 --> 24:21.540
(He's busy fighting a war.)

24:21.980 --> 24:22.700
(Just go.)

24:24.780 --> 24:25.780
(Check the waterway.)

24:33.382 --> 24:34.500
(Are there any sea mines?)

24:34.540 --> 24:35.737
(I heard that there are some.)

24:37.300 --> 24:38.940
(Fool, put your back into it.)

24:39.340 --> 24:40.380
(Put your back into it!)

24:40.380 --> 24:41.500
(Pull the rope!)

24:45.140 --> 24:46.300
(Go away.)

25:04.450 --> 25:05.530
Sorry about that.

25:06.240 --> 25:07.840
The training has been quite tiring.

25:08.730 --> 25:12.010
The main thing is
that the movie is too boring.

25:12.010 --> 25:13.550
I started to yawn while watching it.

25:14.770 --> 25:15.340
It's fine.

25:15.770 --> 25:17.730
I didn't watch the whole film either.

25:17.970 --> 25:18.810
Yeah, right?

25:19.100 --> 25:20.870
You think the movie
is boring too, right?

25:21.226 --> 25:21.970
What about this?

25:22.048 --> 25:23.370
After this, I'll get two tickets

25:23.370 --> 25:24.800
to "Walter Defends Sarajevo".

25:24.900 --> 25:27.140
The movie scenes are very exhilarating.

25:30.450 --> 25:31.290
I'm home.

25:32.860 --> 25:34.940
This is our factory's
staff housing, right?

25:35.182 --> 25:36.782
I think I've never been here before.

25:38.340 --> 25:39.450
I'll head back first.

25:40.340 --> 25:40.940
Fei Ni,

25:43.340 --> 25:45.200
are you free after work tomorrow?

25:48.626 --> 25:50.080
If so, let's catch another movie.

25:50.450 --> 25:51.530
The one I said just now.

25:51.804 --> 25:53.182
The one with exhilarating scenes.

25:53.337 --> 25:53.770
Alright.

25:53.970 --> 25:55.970
I'll wait for you
by the entrance tomorrow.

25:59.490 --> 26:00.100
Fei Ni.

26:00.900 --> 26:01.450
Mom.

26:03.660 --> 26:04.090
Mrs. Fei.

26:04.760 --> 26:05.560
I'm Ye Feng.

26:05.582 --> 26:06.620
Ms. Liu of Jiangcheng
No. 1 Textile Factory

26:06.620 --> 26:08.626
introduced me to her
as her blind date partner.

26:08.860 --> 26:09.970
I know.

26:10.810 --> 26:11.930
Nice to meet you, Mrs. Fei.

26:12.182 --> 26:13.937
- Nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you.

26:17.050 --> 26:18.690
So, why are you guys standing here?

26:19.180 --> 26:20.210
Come and have a seat.

26:20.210 --> 26:21.770
Mom, he has basketball training today.

26:23.050 --> 26:24.260
Not today.

26:24.690 --> 26:26.230
It's not like I train every day.

26:26.660 --> 26:27.290
Yeah, right?

26:27.290 --> 26:27.690
Yeah.

26:27.715 --> 26:28.970
- Come to my house.
- Mrs. Liu.

26:29.004 --> 26:30.440
Let me carry the groceries for you.

26:30.620 --> 26:31.380
Please go ahead.

26:31.537 --> 26:32.450
What a sensible boy.

26:32.450 --> 26:33.840
- Look at him.
- Please go ahead.

26:34.900 --> 26:36.320
Is basketball training exhausting?

26:36.420 --> 26:37.137
It's not that bad.

26:37.250 --> 26:39.100
You're so tall.

26:39.260 --> 26:39.900
I'm 1.85 m tall.

26:40.471 --> 26:41.140
That's great.

26:41.140 --> 26:43.026
I'll make some delicious dishes
for you tonight.

26:43.026 --> 26:45.140
Isn't that Ms. Xu's son?

26:45.580 --> 26:47.420
Did he get together with Fei Ni?

26:47.900 --> 26:48.850
Baoying, you're back.

26:49.380 --> 26:50.140
Who is that?

26:50.660 --> 26:52.100
It's Ni's colleague.

26:52.820 --> 26:53.690
Over here.

26:53.840 --> 26:54.290
Alright.

26:56.210 --> 26:57.490
What colleague?

26:57.490 --> 26:59.120
That's Ms. Xu's son.

26:59.226 --> 27:01.448
I suppose Fei Ni is
perching on a high branch now.

27:02.730 --> 27:04.140
Fei, what are you doing?

27:04.450 --> 27:05.970
This is our mosquito net.

27:05.970 --> 27:06.880
I've washed it, and I...

27:06.880 --> 27:08.940
Just put it aside for now.
We have a guest.

27:08.940 --> 27:09.620
Hurry and come.

27:11.620 --> 27:12.580
Let me introduce him.

27:12.580 --> 27:14.760
This is the blind date partner
Ms. Liu introduced to Ni.

27:14.760 --> 27:15.315
He's Ye Feng.

27:15.337 --> 27:16.140
This is Ni's father.

27:16.140 --> 27:17.010
Hello, Mr. Fei.

27:17.010 --> 27:17.848
My name is Ye Feng.

27:17.848 --> 27:19.100
Nice to meet you.

27:20.293 --> 27:21.620
I have something to tell you.

27:21.620 --> 27:22.360
What is it?

27:22.900 --> 27:25.120
Mr. Fei, I already fixed the door.

27:25.490 --> 27:26.940
It won't make a noise anymore.

27:30.337 --> 27:31.804
That's the thing I want to tell you.

27:32.820 --> 27:33.420
Fei Ni,

27:34.026 --> 27:35.730
I've been waiting for you for two hours.

27:35.730 --> 27:36.550
I'm hungry now.

27:38.530 --> 27:41.160
If so, you should stay
and have dinner with us.

27:41.290 --> 27:41.860
Okay.

27:54.100 --> 27:54.620
Drink up.

27:58.426 --> 27:59.420
This is Biluochun tea.

28:00.226 --> 28:01.620
It's my mother's favorite tea.

28:02.140 --> 28:02.930
Me too.

28:10.380 --> 28:12.360
Ms. Xu has the real deal.

28:13.380 --> 28:15.190
Mine are just crumbs.

28:15.380 --> 28:16.140
It's not that good.

28:16.730 --> 28:17.380
It's good.

28:32.180 --> 28:35.180
How has Ms. Xu been doing lately?

28:36.004 --> 28:37.137
She's been doing well.

28:45.150 --> 28:47.560
How have you been doing
in the hospital lately?

28:47.604 --> 28:48.737
I've been doing well.

28:50.626 --> 28:52.182
I suppose everyone is doing well.

28:52.580 --> 28:54.680
Let me check if dinner is ready.

29:08.800 --> 29:10.050
I heard from my mother

29:10.093 --> 29:11.426
that your head was damaged.

29:11.980 --> 29:13.250
You cannot remember the past.

29:19.520 --> 29:20.940
I heard from Mr. Fei

29:21.204 --> 29:23.300
that Fei Ni didn't come
to visit me at the hospital

29:23.760 --> 29:25.510
because she was watching
a movie with you.

29:57.420 --> 29:58.410
It's all my fault.

29:58.900 --> 30:00.250
I wouldn't have kept Fang here

30:00.250 --> 30:02.360
had I known Ye was coming.

30:02.690 --> 30:04.280
Why did you come here?

30:04.515 --> 30:06.937
What if Fang said something
that he wasn't supposed to?

30:07.026 --> 30:07.840
Hurry and go back.

30:08.790 --> 30:10.960
I don't know what to chat about
even if I go back.

30:10.960 --> 30:12.380
It's so awkward.

30:12.770 --> 30:14.400
Why don't we send Ni to them?

30:15.580 --> 30:16.580
Have you lost your mind?

30:16.580 --> 30:18.240
It'll be even more awkward
if Ni is there.

30:22.026 --> 30:23.810
- Fei Ni, as for dinner...
- Come with me.

30:28.660 --> 30:29.940
Where are you going?

30:30.740 --> 30:31.160
I...

30:33.180 --> 30:33.610
This...

30:33.940 --> 30:34.970
Is our daughter

30:34.970 --> 30:37.200
two-timing them?

30:37.760 --> 30:39.290
Shut up if you don't know what to say.

30:40.337 --> 30:41.271
Head to Li's house.

30:41.271 --> 30:42.610
They bought braised beef yesterday.

30:42.626 --> 30:43.970
I'm sure they have some leftovers.

30:43.970 --> 30:45.140
Go and borrow some from them.

30:45.426 --> 30:47.240
Why are we borrowing
braised beef from them?

30:47.450 --> 30:50.050
We have guests here today,
but we don't even have meat dishes.

30:50.050 --> 30:51.250
How could that be appropriate?

30:51.271 --> 30:54.080
Besides, it's embarrassing for Ni to
show other people how poor we are.

30:54.620 --> 30:55.140
Just go.

30:55.140 --> 30:55.690
Okay.

30:55.690 --> 30:56.250
Go now.

31:12.515 --> 31:14.048
How did you manage to locate my house?

31:14.620 --> 31:15.830
I asked Nurse Zhou.

31:16.580 --> 31:17.890
She told me your house address.

31:17.915 --> 31:19.529
She even taught me how to take a cab.

31:19.530 --> 31:21.440
It's been a few days since
you last visited me.

31:21.760 --> 31:23.582
That's why I thought of visiting you.

31:28.690 --> 31:29.450
What happened?

31:29.450 --> 31:31.426
Didn't I already teach you
how to wash your clothes?

31:31.448 --> 31:33.190
Why didn't you wash it? It's so dirty.

31:34.537 --> 31:36.690
You didn't even sew back
the button that had dropped.

31:36.730 --> 31:38.100
If other people see this,

31:38.137 --> 31:39.560
they might treat you as a thug.

31:39.970 --> 31:41.800
I did, but I was terrible at it.

31:42.048 --> 31:42.960
I pricked my finger.

31:59.471 --> 32:01.710
Don't you know how to tie back
your untied shoelaces?

32:02.580 --> 32:04.010
It's dangerous, you know?

32:08.210 --> 32:09.270
Are you free tomorrow?

32:09.648 --> 32:11.093
I'll treat you to some ice cream.

32:13.180 --> 32:13.990
I'm not free.

32:14.580 --> 32:16.660
Did you watch a movie
with Ye Feng today?

32:17.320 --> 32:18.080
Was it nice?

32:19.450 --> 32:20.020
It's okay.

32:20.730 --> 32:22.360
Did you not visit me
because you went out

32:23.140 --> 32:24.180
to watch a movie with him?

32:28.315 --> 32:29.530
So what if that's the case?

32:29.920 --> 32:31.200
If you want to watch a movie,

32:32.093 --> 32:33.320
I can keep you company too.

32:34.537 --> 32:36.293
I can be your
blind date partner as well.

32:40.648 --> 32:42.260
It's getting late. You should go now.

32:42.960 --> 32:44.110
Do you know the way back?

32:44.730 --> 32:45.510
I'm not dumb.

32:46.204 --> 32:47.010
I know the way back.

32:48.180 --> 32:50.430
I won't keep you around for dinner.

32:51.760 --> 32:52.782
You should go now.

32:53.248 --> 32:54.360
You should head back first.

32:55.137 --> 32:56.715
I'll stay here until you enter the door.

33:20.210 --> 33:22.710
I didn't expect your parents
to be this passionate.

33:22.937 --> 33:26.004
To think that I met your parents
right after our first encounter.

33:28.050 --> 33:28.600
Fei Ni,

33:29.026 --> 33:30.940
why don't I pick you up
for work tomorrow?

33:30.940 --> 33:32.550
We can have breakfast together.

33:35.050 --> 33:35.660
Ye Feng,

33:38.050 --> 33:39.280
what does Ms. Xu

33:40.400 --> 33:41.870
think about our relationship?

33:42.820 --> 33:43.440
My mom?

33:44.380 --> 33:46.010
I haven't had
the chance to tell her yet.

33:46.048 --> 33:48.648
When I heard that Ms. Liu was
trying to find you a husband,

33:48.650 --> 33:49.730
I sought her help immediately

33:49.730 --> 33:51.626
so that I could go on
a blind date with you.

33:51.970 --> 33:53.010
But don't worry.

33:53.010 --> 33:54.660
My mom always listens to me.

33:54.780 --> 33:56.650
She won't say no
as long as I'm happy with it.

33:57.240 --> 34:00.179
I never expected the blind date partner
Ms. Liu had recommended to be you.

34:00.180 --> 34:01.270
I... What's wrong with me?

34:01.270 --> 34:02.293
You're a good person.

34:03.040 --> 34:05.280
You're too good for me.

34:06.560 --> 34:07.530
You know this, too.

34:08.150 --> 34:10.560
Compared to your family background,

34:11.020 --> 34:11.780
my family is...

34:12.090 --> 34:13.650
I don't think that's an issue.

34:13.840 --> 34:14.340
Fei Ni.

34:14.860 --> 34:15.970
Let me finish.

34:18.850 --> 34:21.060
I have an elder brother called Fei Ting.

34:21.900 --> 34:23.760
He spent his entire youth
in the countryside.

34:23.980 --> 34:25.300
He'll return to the city soon.

34:25.493 --> 34:27.404
If the district office
cannot find a job for him

34:27.426 --> 34:28.950
when he's back,

34:30.093 --> 34:31.337
I...

34:32.380 --> 34:34.160
might offer my position to him.

34:35.110 --> 34:36.900
Did your parents instruct you to do so?

34:36.900 --> 34:37.410
No.

34:38.200 --> 34:39.600
It's my own call.

34:40.860 --> 34:43.050
Actually, he was supposed
to take over my job.

34:43.740 --> 34:46.670
I was the one who was supposed
to be sent to the countryside.

34:46.780 --> 34:47.640
He doted on me.

34:47.671 --> 34:48.750
He didn't want me to suffer.

34:48.893 --> 34:50.550
Therefore, he let me take over his job.

34:50.940 --> 34:51.930
No matter what,

34:52.293 --> 34:53.782
I should return the job to him.

34:55.380 --> 34:56.470
What will you do, then?

34:56.471 --> 34:58.740
I know how to make clothes.
I can make a living myself.

34:58.740 --> 34:59.850
How could that be the same?

34:59.937 --> 35:02.700
Having a job in Jiangcheng No. 1
Textile Factory means a stable life.

35:02.760 --> 35:04.271
If you make and sell your own clothes,

35:04.315 --> 35:05.826
it's the same as being jobless.

35:06.050 --> 35:07.500
If so, how could my mother let you...

35:10.490 --> 35:11.780
Fei Ni, that's not what I mean...

35:11.780 --> 35:12.490
I understand.

35:16.260 --> 35:19.400
That's why
I'm telling you this in advance.

35:19.650 --> 35:21.130
If both you and Ms. Xu

35:21.350 --> 35:22.440
cannot accept this fact,

35:22.940 --> 35:24.170
I understand.

35:26.010 --> 35:27.080
Ye Feng, it's fine.

35:27.260 --> 35:28.850
You should head back and think about it.

35:31.610 --> 35:33.610
Alright. I'll think about it.

35:34.260 --> 35:35.300
I'll be going now.

35:35.448 --> 35:37.471
It's getting late.
You should hurry and head back.

35:39.570 --> 35:40.130
See you.

35:57.900 --> 36:00.120
Jiangcheng No. 1
Textile Factory Basketball Team

36:00.120 --> 36:01.750
(Study Hard and Work Tirelessly)
Achieved Outstanding Results Again.

36:02.450 --> 36:04.780
(Physically and Mentally Strong)
This team has a strong mentality,

36:04.970 --> 36:06.090
strong physical capabilities,

36:06.337 --> 36:07.840
and strong technical capabilities.

36:08.300 --> 36:10.610
Among the members,
their captain, Ye Feng,

36:11.220 --> 36:12.610
deserved great credit.

36:16.170 --> 36:17.220
Ling Yi?

36:17.940 --> 36:19.620
This reporter has great taste.

36:21.130 --> 36:22.500
This name is great as well.

36:23.315 --> 36:25.537
I can tell
that this reporter is well-educated.

36:27.260 --> 36:28.180
You're back.

36:29.010 --> 36:29.780
I'm back.

36:31.010 --> 36:31.600
Hurry.

36:31.740 --> 36:32.350
Take a look.

36:32.740 --> 36:33.970
You're in the newspaper.

36:38.490 --> 36:40.070
This reporter, named Ling Yi,

36:40.340 --> 36:41.740
knew you?

36:42.050 --> 36:43.570
You got high praise.

36:43.700 --> 36:45.860
Not only were you good at basketball,

36:45.960 --> 36:48.137
but you also had a high
revolutionary consciousness.

36:48.140 --> 36:50.560
This is not a praise but a fact.

36:53.650 --> 36:55.350
The name sounds feminine.

36:55.610 --> 36:58.120
Try to inquire about her
and buy her a meal.

37:02.610 --> 37:03.260
What's wrong?

37:03.515 --> 37:06.093
What's with the long face?
Did you lose your basketball match?

37:09.970 --> 37:10.450
Mom,

37:11.260 --> 37:12.220
say,

37:13.050 --> 37:14.650
if I get married,

37:15.340 --> 37:16.920
but my wife is jobless,

37:17.050 --> 37:18.000
can you accept that?

37:18.940 --> 37:20.400
No way.

37:23.315 --> 37:24.700
Did you get yourself a girlfriend?

37:26.115 --> 37:27.680
Not yet, but...

37:28.315 --> 37:30.093
We're getting to know each other.

37:31.050 --> 37:31.740
Who is it?

37:32.210 --> 37:33.570
She's jobless, huh?

37:34.426 --> 37:35.804
Is she a returning educated youth?

37:36.570 --> 37:37.360
No.

37:37.740 --> 37:39.340
She has a job now.

37:39.920 --> 37:42.190
But she said she would
offer her job to her elder brother

37:42.420 --> 37:44.170
after his return.

37:45.940 --> 37:47.280
Who exactly is it?

37:47.520 --> 37:48.480
Do I know her?

37:49.220 --> 37:50.360
You do know her.

37:51.110 --> 37:53.230
It's Fei Ni from our factory.

37:55.900 --> 37:57.600
Are you dating Fei Ni?

37:57.820 --> 37:59.290
Not yet.

37:59.570 --> 38:01.740
That's why I'm asking
for your opinion first.

38:02.170 --> 38:03.210
Of course not.

38:04.804 --> 38:07.480
With your background, you can find
all kinds of excellent partners.

38:07.610 --> 38:09.450
Why must you find a factory worker?

38:12.650 --> 38:14.140
Mom, look at what you're saying.

38:14.260 --> 38:16.182
It's like you're belittling
the working class!

38:17.380 --> 38:18.820
What nonsense are you talking about?

38:18.937 --> 38:20.860
Since when did I belittle
the working class?

38:20.860 --> 38:22.170
You said it just now.

38:22.170 --> 38:23.260
Don't spout such nonsense!

38:23.260 --> 38:23.960
You said it here.

38:23.982 --> 38:24.626
Lower your volume!

38:24.648 --> 38:25.130
Make me!

38:25.130 --> 38:25.970
Hush!

38:26.170 --> 38:28.570
Hey, I'm the factory manager!

38:28.570 --> 38:29.820
What's with the feather duster?

38:29.860 --> 38:31.137
You think I can't handle you?

38:31.137 --> 38:32.090
I'll teach you a lesson!

38:32.090 --> 38:33.820
How dare you spout such nonsense?

38:33.820 --> 38:34.582
You ungrateful son!

38:34.604 --> 38:36.890
I'm going to date
an ordinary factory worker!

38:37.280 --> 38:39.480
If you object to it,
I'll tell everyone in the factory

38:39.480 --> 38:41.050
that you belittle the working class!

38:41.050 --> 38:41.970
Mom, please stop!

38:41.970 --> 38:42.480
It hurts!

38:43.490 --> 38:43.940
It hurts!

38:49.860 --> 38:50.570
Fine.

38:52.640 --> 38:54.050
You want to date Fei Ni?

38:54.520 --> 38:55.530
I won't object to it.

38:56.420 --> 38:57.440
But only on one condition.

39:03.300 --> 39:04.490
What condition,

39:04.490 --> 39:04.980
Mom?

39:07.220 --> 39:09.040
I won't object to it

39:09.700 --> 39:11.100
as long as Fei Ni

39:11.515 --> 39:12.580
doesn't attend college.

39:15.740 --> 39:17.010
Son, you have no idea.

39:17.380 --> 39:20.080
She's been trying to enroll in
college for the past few years.

39:21.130 --> 39:21.940
Think about it.

39:22.260 --> 39:24.130
If you two do get married,

39:24.226 --> 39:25.530
and she does enroll in college,

39:25.860 --> 39:27.740
she'll be away for a few years.

39:27.826 --> 39:29.848
That's the same
as you being a bachelor, you know?

39:34.970 --> 39:35.420
Alright.

39:36.340 --> 39:37.450
I'll agree on her behalf.

39:39.050 --> 39:40.380
You'll agree on her behalf?

39:42.130 --> 39:42.780
Mom,

39:42.780 --> 39:43.600
just think about it.

39:43.740 --> 39:45.380
Why would anyone enroll in college

39:45.790 --> 39:47.260
when they could get married to me?

39:47.260 --> 39:47.970
Don't you agree?

39:51.671 --> 39:53.826
You must be exhausted
from all the beating just now.

39:54.170 --> 39:54.640
Here.

39:55.130 --> 39:56.130
Have some tea

39:56.260 --> 39:56.970
and calm down.

39:57.700 --> 39:58.570
Just leave this

39:59.740 --> 40:00.940
to me.

40:03.260 --> 40:03.830
Alright.

40:04.582 --> 40:05.450
I'll be leaving now.

40:06.271 --> 40:07.515
That beating you gave me

40:08.260 --> 40:09.020
was quite harsh.

40:17.580 --> 40:22.300
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

40:27.050 --> 40:27.610
Fei Ni.

40:28.450 --> 40:28.990
Fei Ni.

40:32.420 --> 40:34.230
Let's watch another movie tonight.

40:34.570 --> 40:36.640
This time,
I promise I won't fall asleep.

40:45.090 --> 40:46.780
As for what you said to me yesterday,

40:46.780 --> 40:47.937
I've given it some thought.

40:48.220 --> 40:49.700
I don't think it's an issue for me.

40:50.380 --> 40:51.700
You're not even sure

40:51.715 --> 40:52.870
when your brother will return.

40:52.920 --> 40:54.240
Besides, even if he did come back,

40:54.240 --> 40:56.048
he might not take over
your job necessarily.

40:56.071 --> 40:57.715
Let's say, for the sake of argument,

40:58.170 --> 40:59.610
you did lose your job,

40:59.671 --> 41:01.515
I'm sure my mother
will do something about it.

41:03.530 --> 41:04.240
Ye Feng,

41:04.740 --> 41:06.030
did you misunderstand something?

41:06.480 --> 41:08.619
I didn't mean to let you help me
resolve the job issue

41:08.620 --> 41:09.940
that my brother and I would face.

41:09.940 --> 41:10.800
It's fine.

41:11.130 --> 41:12.350
Once we get married,

41:12.490 --> 41:13.530
we'll be a family.

41:13.530 --> 41:15.137
Everything will be negotiable by then.

41:15.530 --> 41:16.010
Fei Ni.

41:20.820 --> 41:21.150
You...

41:21.450 --> 41:22.600
What are you doing here?

41:22.860 --> 41:23.780
I have a button now,

41:23.960 --> 41:25.448
but I don't know how to sew it back.

41:25.650 --> 41:26.450
Please teach me.

41:28.650 --> 41:29.480
Fang Muyang,

41:30.450 --> 41:32.340
for a simple task
such as sewing a button on,

41:32.570 --> 41:34.780
you can ask the doctors and
the nurses to teach you.

41:34.915 --> 41:37.150
If they don't know, you can ask
your fellow patients.

41:37.226 --> 41:39.010
Fei Ni and I are going to watch a movie.

41:39.860 --> 41:40.320
Fei Ni,

41:40.610 --> 41:41.180
let's go.

41:42.050 --> 41:42.740
Really?

41:44.420 --> 41:46.804
Can I join? I've never
watched a movie before.

41:47.360 --> 41:48.610
I don't think it's appropriate.

41:48.671 --> 41:51.560
I'll head to the hospital and teach you
in a few more days, okay?

41:52.970 --> 41:53.560
Okay.

42:00.570 --> 42:01.130
Fei Ni,

42:02.120 --> 42:03.600
how do I get back to the hospital?

42:05.760 --> 42:07.050
I forgot how I got here.

42:07.050 --> 42:09.030
Didn't you come from that direction?

42:14.700 --> 42:15.360
Forget it, then.

42:15.560 --> 42:16.960
You guys should watch the movie.

42:17.004 --> 42:17.737
Just ignore me.

42:17.826 --> 42:19.700
I can...
I think this is the right direction.

42:19.700 --> 42:20.260
Fang Muyang,

42:20.570 --> 42:21.730
where are you going?

42:22.915 --> 42:24.204
I suppose it's that direction.

42:27.300 --> 42:29.520
Why don't we send him back first?

42:29.648 --> 42:31.050
We can watch a movie after that.

42:31.382 --> 42:33.170
But we won't make it in time
if we do so.

42:34.740 --> 42:35.180
But...

42:50.940 --> 42:51.990
Stop staring at her.

42:52.050 --> 42:52.720
Look ahead.

42:53.570 --> 42:54.580
Just focus on the road.

42:59.300 --> 43:00.570
Hurry up.

43:00.570 --> 43:02.204
This is how fast I'll go.
Stop patting me.

43:02.226 --> 43:03.820
You're so heavy. How can I go fast?

43:06.260 --> 43:07.410
Stop hugging me.

43:07.410 --> 43:08.440
Hurry up.

43:08.440 --> 43:09.180
It's so ticklish.

43:11.010 --> 43:11.700
Let go.

43:12.170 --> 43:13.780
If not, I'll let go of the handles.

43:14.340 --> 43:14.900
Go ahead.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
